{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/e2c7f76590484719f70855fe6c0c0d8a.poster.avif?t=1775714980\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/e2c7f76590484719f70855fe6c0c0d8a.webm?t=1775714980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/e2c7f76590484719f70855fe6c0c0d8a.mp4?t=1775714980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Bullet Hell Card Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decks of Dexterity fuses bullet hell shooter gameplay with a strategic turn based card game; your deck determines your power! <strong>Get in the flow</strong>: dodge bullets, collect power cells, and  play your turn to unleash powerful attacks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Void to discover:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500+ Collectable Cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ Rare Treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ Character events and Quests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice contributes to building a powerful deck to defeat the corruption!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/a74ac73a44312c331e16f3cf1d025f00.avif?t=1775714980\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras_big/a74ac73a44312c331e16f3cf1d025f00.webp?t=1775714980 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crazy Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just a top down shooter! Unlock unique classes with special mechanics and cards:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast enemies with machine guns, sniper rifles, and critical hits with Gun Slinger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain turns together to create COMBOS and use melee attacks with Blade Master!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness energy beams that deal damage over time with Electromancer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the flow of time and space with Time Turner!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/3109e42e8d71342fff07ed70dc8396c5.poster.avif?t=1775714980\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/3109e42e8d71342fff07ed70dc8396c5.webm?t=1775714980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/3109e42e8d71342fff07ed70dc8396c5.mp4?t=1775714980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hybrid Bullet Hell + Card Game Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles flow smoothly between bullet hell  and turn based card game  gameplay. Collect a power cell, time pauses, and you get to <strong>take your turn!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards have mechanics that affect both games: some transform bullets in the arena\u00a0into health, while others allow you to draw more cards, or save them for future turns. <strong>Bullet Hell + Card Game fused together!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/a317bbc7c15e2bb4f7853d202c63d9d6.avif?t=1775714980\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras_big/a317bbc7c15e2bb4f7853d202c63d9d6.avif?t=1775714980 width=1560 height=304 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards are Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attack, teleport, heal, and ability are the cards in your deck. Combine them together, burn them, and find synergies to survive and defeat enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful deck makes the difference between <strong>death </strong>or<strong> going infinite!</strong>\u00a0One shot your enemies!  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/3ecd21423708b777ad76664a9121e31b.poster.avif?t=1775714980\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/3ecd21423708b777ad76664a9121e31b.webm?t=1775714980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/3ecd21423708b777ad76664a9121e31b.mp4?t=1775714980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wacky Events, Characters, and Campaigns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Void contains anything and everything... but a mysterious disease is corrupting its citizens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help repair robots, race cowboys, negotiate with traders, and beware of the <span class=\"bb_strike\">duck's</span> rituals! Meet dozens of characters and complete quests for extremely powerful rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/1bd2b002c5428fa8a920866324afb0f2.poster.avif?t=1775714980\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/1bd2b002c5428fa8a920866324afb0f2.webm?t=1775714980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/1bd2b002c5428fa8a920866324afb0f2.mp4?t=1775714980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decks of Dexterity has been built around its community. During its 8 years of development many features have been added to build strong competitive and creative expression:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of Competitive Leaderboards</strong><br>- Speedrun campaigns, go for huge overkills, or compete in the Monthly Trail! <br>- There are hundreds of ways to <strong>show your skills!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modding Built In </strong><br>- Don't just build your deck, <strong>build your own class!</strong> <br>- Download custom classes, campaigns, events, bosses, and gameplay modifiers. <br>- Dex's built in modding tools allow the game to be completely changed!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/b88fd691c0f3c50b64f7e978fd57500c.avif?t=1775714980\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras_big/b88fd691c0f3c50b64f7e978fd57500c.avif?t=1775714980 width=1560 height=304 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decks of Dexterity contains awesome music by awesome creators! Artists include Punch Deck, JDB Artist, Kevin MacLeod, and GameDevYal alongside original music! Non-original music is licensed under Creative Commons by Attribution (4.0).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/968530?t=1775714980","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775714980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/47e0d7a60b5952351451c9c822747ae88fbcc0ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775714980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/47e0d7a60b5952351451c9c822747ae88fbcc0ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775714980","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequent battles with cartoon violence. Cards reference various weapons including guns, swords, and attack techniques. Red particle effects are used to represent blood. Dialog has references to topics such as anxiety, crude humor (puns), and one use of a swear word. "},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3984760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/e2c7f76590484719f70855fe6c0c0d8a.poster.avif?t=1775714980\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968530/extras/e2c7f76590484719f70855fe6c0c0d8a.webm?t=1775714980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src